| --- |\r | Implementation/topology | `qwen35` dense hybrid |\r | Public model name | `Qwable-27B-Chadrock-ROCmFPX-ULTRAQUALITY-7.61BPW` |\r | Internal recipe ID | `rocmfpx.qwen35.dense.ultraquality.v1` |\r | Quant policy | ROCmFPX Q6 base with ranked leave-32 attention tensors and Q6_K splice |\r | Output BPW | 7.6146 |\r | Output bytes | 26,004,616,416 |\r | SHA256 | `14cb3fb0670163a1b0f73c5df521ce0513cfddd7609d75d0640d00a07537073e` |\r | Serving profile | Strix Halo ROCm, q8 target KV, f16 MTP draft KV |\r \r The policy starts from `Q6_0_ROCMFPX` and uses a generated\r `--tensor-type-file` to restore selected dense FFN and attention tensors to\r `Q6_K`, while leaving the best 32 attention tensors in ROCmFPX according to\r `qwable-ultraquality-7p61bpw-att","id":"fix_lessons:ROCmFPX\\docs\\recipes\\qwable-ultraquality-7p61bpw-rankleave32.md","metadata":{"extension":"md","geometry_map":[-0.02748393639922142,0.03847167640924454,0.04131820797920227,0.030324237421154976,0.03330054134130478,0.04714478552341461,0.032947368919849396,-0.024663932621479034,-0.027761738747358322,0.007634024601429701],"path":"C:\\Users\\HADES\\Desktop\\finetuneqwen3.827b\\ROCmFPX\\docs\\recipes\\qwable-ultraquality-7p61bpw-rankleave32.md","security":{"audit_needed":false,"risk_level":0.30000001192092896,"security_tier":"STANDARD"},"size":5389},"tags":[],"timestamp":1786891162},{"category":"file_map","content":"ROCmFPX\\examples\\model-conversion\\scripts\\utils\\inspect-org-model.py: #!/usr/bin/env python3\r \r import argparse\r import json\r import os\r import re\r import struct\r import sys\r from pathlib import Path\r from typing import Optional\r from safetensors import safe_open\r \r \r MODEL_SAFETENSORS_FILE = \"model.safetensors\"\r MODEL_SAFETENSORS_INDEX = \"model.safetensors.index.json\"\r \r DTYPE_SIZES = {\r     \"F64\": 8, \"I64\": 8, \"U64\": 8,\r     \"F32\": 4, \"I32\": 4, \"U32\": 4,\r     \"F16","id":"file_map:ROCmFPX\\examples\\model-conversion\\scripts\\utils\\inspect-org-