ectory of the repository to define specific configurations for that model.\r \r Example:\r \r ```ini\r hf-repo-draft = username/my-draft-model-GGUF\r temp = 0.5\r top-k = 20\r top-p = 0.95\r ```\r \r For security reasons, only certain options are allowed. Please refer to [preset.cpp](../common/preset.cpp) for the complete list of permitted options.\r \r Example usage:\r \r Assuming your repository `username/my-model-with-preset` contains a `preset.ini` with the configuration above:\r \r ```sh\r llama-cli -hf username/my-","id":"fix_lessons:ROCmFPX\\docs\\preset.md","metadata":{"extension":"md","geometry_map":[-0.031616948544979095,0.0354221947491169,0.0349140428006649,0.028472987934947014,0.026582788676023483,0.040642544627189636,0.028876498341560364,-0.02565326727926731,-0.026896975934505463,0.006372600793838501],"path":"C:\\Users\\HADES\\Desktop\\finetuneqwen3.827b\\ROCmFPX\\docs\\preset.md","security":{"audit_needed":false,"risk_level":0.0,"security_tier":"STANDARD"},"size":2946},"tags":[],"timestamp":1786891162},{"category":"file_map","content":"ROCmFPX\\examples\\llama.swiftui\\llama.swiftui\\UI\\DownloadButton.swift: import SwiftUI\r \r struct DownloadButton: View {\r     @ObservedObject private var llamaState: LlamaState\r     private var modelName: String\r     private var modelUrl: String\r     private var filename: String\r \r     @State private var status: String\r \r     @State private var downloadTask: URLSessionDownloadTask?\r     @State private var progress = 0.0\r     @State private var observation: NSKeyValueOb","id":"file_map:ROCmFPX\\examples\\llama.swiftui\\llama.swiftui\\UI\\DownloadButton.swift","metadata":{"extension":"swift","geometry_map":[-0.03632372245192528,0.03561113774776459,0.021899187937378883,0.03219268471002579,0.03496791049838066,0.04910069331526756,0.03795820102095604,-0.01854025572538376,-0.007706725504249334,0.005185231100767851],"path":"C:\\Users\\HADES\\Desktop\\finetuneqwen3.827b\\ROCmFPX\\examples\\llama.swiftui\\llama.swift