oE) is not. Student capacity ceiling = 3.6-A3B; we push it toward 3.8 ON the coding distribution.  ### Execution stack (decided) - **Base image:** AMD Developer Cloud \"Unsloth Studio (ROCm 7.2.4)\" — ships ROCm torch   (2.11+rocm7.2) + Unsloth pre-built. Activate its env; install nothing that pulls torch. - **Teach","id":"fix_lessons:PLAN.md","metadata":{"extension":"md","geometry_map":[-0.028950005769729614,-0.0019581138622015715,0.00995491910725832,0.038976360112428665,0.034549497067928314,-0.02551916427910328,0.02825547754764557,-0.0093898456543684,-0.04072829335927963,0.032510075718164444],"path":"C:\\Users\\HADES\\Desktop\\finetuneqwen3.827b\\PLAN.md","security":{"audit_needed":false,"risk_level":0.30000001192092896,"security_tier":"STANDARD"},"size":10735},"tags":[],"timestamp":1786891162},{"category":"file_map","content":"ROCmFPX\\ggml\\src\\ggml-cpu\\arch\\arm\\quants.c: #define GGML_COMMON_IMPL_C\r #include \"ggml-common.h\"\r #include \"ggml-quants.h\"\r #include \"ggml-impl.h\"\r #include \"ggml-cpu.h\"\r #include \"simd-mappings.h\"\r \r #include \"../../quants.h\"\r #include \"../../ggml-cpu-impl.h\"\r \r #include <math.h>\r #include <string.h>\r #include <assert.h>\r #include <float.h>\r #include <stdlib.h> // for qsort\r #include <stdio.h>  // for GGML_ASSERT\r \r #define GROUP_MAX_EPS 1","id":"file_map:ROCmFPX\\ggml\\src\\ggml-cpu\\arch\\arm\\quants.c","metadata":{"extension":"c","geometry_map":[-0.0472378209233284,0.03477779030799866,0.03071526624262333,0.04308363422751427,0.034289419651031494,0.03354169428348541,0.03347426652908325,-0.03175389766693115,-0.01876547560095787,0.017476985231041908],"path":"C:\\Users\\HADES\\Desktop\\finetuneqwen3.827b\\ROCmFPX\\ggml\\src\\ggml-cpu\\arch\\arm\\quants.c","security":{"audit_needed":false,"risk_level":0.0,"security_tier":"STANDARD"},"size":218466},"tags":[],"timestamp":1786891162},{"category":"file_map","content":"ROCmFPX\\ggml\\src\\ggml-virtgpu\\virtgpu-forward-backend.cpp: #include \"virtgpu-forward-im